      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "For your 1345-times-100 check, what calculation can you carry out yourself now, rather than asking a model you have not observed? What result does that calculation actually give, and what comparison remains unavailable? In English, what specific next action will that observation change, and what unfinished state and source will you carry forward?"
